{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_cannon_crew","model_identifier":"dwarf_cannon_crew","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_cannon_crew\n\nDwarf cannon crew (A4), cities only, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nSoot-smudged dwarf gunner's mate: charcoal shirt with rolled red sleeves, heavy leather apron, tool belt, a wool cap; works the dwarf cannon with a rammer (rammer head forward, sponge at the butt) and a linstock with a smouldering slow match (hidden, swapped in for fire).\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.0, z -6.0..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ram` | 1.6 | once | key 0.70 s: rammer driven home into the muzzle (in front, about 20 u up and 40 u forward) |\n| `aim` | 2 | loop | heaving on the handspike at the breech to traverse (loop, no key) |\n| `fire` | 1.8 | once | key 0.80 s: linstock touches the touch hole (show `linstock`, hide `rammer` from the start of the clip); leans away 1.05 s |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | rammer upright at the right side |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.56 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `ram`: key 0.70 s: rammer driven home into the muzzle (in front, about 20 u up and 40 u forward)\n- `aim`: heaving on the handspike at the breech to traverse (loop, no key)\n- `fire`: key 0.80 s: linstock touches the touch hole (show `linstock`, hide `rammer` from the start of the clip); leans away 1.05 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `rammer` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 56 u pole, grip at the origin, rammer head 40 u forward (-Z), sponge 16 u back\n- `linstock` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): 30 u, `glow_match` is the burning slow match\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- rammer (ram): second grip (left hand) 16 u along the pole forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- Place the crew so the cannon muzzle is about 40 u in front for ram and the breech about 12 u in front for aim/fire.\n"},"description":"# dwarf_cannon_crew\n\nDwarf cannon crew (A4), cities only, 1.3 m = 46 u (cap to 47).\n\nSoot-smudged dwarf gunner's mate: charcoal shirt with rolled red sleeves, heavy leather apron, tool belt, a wool cap; works the dwarf cannon with a rammer (rammer head forward, sponge at the butt) and a linstock with a smouldering slow match (hidden, swapped in for fire).\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..47.0, z -6.0..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 22 x 47 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ram` | 1.6 | once | key 0.70 s: rammer driven home into the muzzle (in front, about 20 u up and 40 u forward) |\n| `aim` | 2 | loop | heaving on the handspike at the breech to traverse (loop, no key) |\n| `fire` | 1.8 | once | key 0.80 s: linstock touches the touch hole (show `linstock`, hide `rammer` from the start of the clip); leans away 1.05 s |\n| `idle` | 3.2 | loop | rammer upright at the right side |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.00 m/s), cycle 0.8 s\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.56 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `ram`: key 0.70 s: rammer driven home into the muzzle (in front, about 20 u up and 40 u forward)\n- `aim`: heaving on the handspike at the breech to traverse (loop, no key)\n- `fire`: key 0.80 s: linstock touches the touch hole (show `linstock`, hide `rammer` from the start of the clip); leans away 1.05 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 46, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 30.5, 6.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3.5, 33, 6.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (6, 37.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 29, -6.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-14.5, 23.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-10.5, 17.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (8, 24, 4)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-8, 24, 4)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `rammer` (visible, under slot_hand_r): 56 u pole, grip at the origin, rammer head 40 u forward (-Z), sponge 16 u back\n- `linstock` (hidden, under slot_hand_r): 30 u, `glow_match` is the burning slow match\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- rammer (ram): second grip (left hand) 16 u along the pole forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_red.png`: red beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_brown.png`: brown beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_black.png`: black beard\n- `dwarf_cannon_crew_grey.png`: grey beard\n\n## Notes\n\n- Place the crew so the cannon muzzle is about 40 u in front for ram and the breech about 12 u in front for aim/fire.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,21.0,-4.5],"to":[7.0,24.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,21.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[103,83,117.0,86.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[14,88,23.0,91.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,88,14.0,91.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[23,88,32.0,91.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[42,48,56.0,57.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[56,48,70.0,57.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"af004420-1933-51ac-9bb7-f18dd9b3bc70"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,24.0,-5.0],"to":[8.0,36.0,5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,24.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[6,0,22.0,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38,0,48.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,0,38.0,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[48,0,58.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[58,0,74.0,10.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[74,0,90.0,10.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f9dd7fa1-29ce-57fd-abc4-a5621c490b79"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,36.0,-2.5],"to":[2.5,37.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,36.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[94,96,99.0,97.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[99,96,104.0,97.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[104,96,109.0,97.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[109,96,114.0,97.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[72,76,77.0,81.0],"textu